~ start
Spirit is the breath that binds the seen and unseen, the strength that rises when all else falls away.
It is the calm voice that tells you to continue, the ember that glows even in the darkest seasons.
Spirit teaches us to rise, to breathe, and to trust the path set before us.
This thread holds the essence that keeps our people standing even in their hardest seasons.  
Let it strengthen your heart, Achieng, for every hero needs a fire within.

Well Done: The fragments of the lumusi merge and release a dazzling light. Your hardwork has paid off.
It is time to head home.
=> END
